Accessories | Premium Performance | Irani MotoHub\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Browse our exclusive collection of Touring Accessories on Irani MotoHub.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/top-box.png?v=1787079291\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Touring Accessories\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:T5a7,📝 Product Description : Built for riders who push the limits, the MOTOCARE Aluminium MX 36 Litre Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp are the ultimate storage companions for serious adventure touring. Made from high-grade aluminium alloy, these panniers feature a tough brushed silver finish and MX styling for a bold, rugged look that complements any adventure or touring motorcycle. With a 36-litre capacity per pannier, these boxes are perfect for storing gear, tools, and travel essentials. The saddle clamp mounting system offers a secure and universal fit for most pannier racks, while the dual locking system and rubber gasket sealing provide security and weatherproof protection. Whether you're navigating rocky trails, highway routes, or weekend rides, the Motocare MX 36L panniers ensure your gear is safe, dry, and ready for the ride. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium MX 36L Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Brushed Silver MX Design Mounting System: Saddle Clamp (compatible with most pannier racks) Locking System: Dual lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (with high-grade rubber gasket) Interior: Foam-padded base for vibration and shock absorption Use Case: Long-distance touring, off-road trails, daily use Bike Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger & more2f:T66e,📝 Product Description : Built for the rugged roads and wild trails, the MOTOCARE Aluminium MX 36 Litre Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp offer the perfect combination of toughness, functionality, and aggressive ADV styling. Featuring a sleek matte black powder-coated finish, these panniers are made from high-strength aircraft-grade aluminium, built to endure the demands of off-road adventures and cross-country touring. Each 36-litre pannier box provides ample storage for riding gear, camping tools, or daily essentials. Designed with dual anti-theft locks, weatherproof rubber gasket sealing, and a universal saddle clamp mounting system, these panniers ensure security, durability, and vibration-free performance. The MX edition design adds a bold, aggressive look ideal for Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, and other touring motorcycles. Whether you're heading into the mountains or across state lines, this setup keeps your essentials protected, dry, and ready to roll. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium MX 36L Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Powder-Coated Matte Black (MX Edition) Mounting System: Saddle Clamp (universal fit for most pannier frames) Locking System: Dual anti-theft lock system with keys Waterproof: Yes (with rubber gasket sealing) Interior: Foam base lining to reduce shock and vibration Use Case: Adventure riding, long-distance touring, daily utility Bike Compatibility: KTM Adventure, Royal Enfield Himalayan, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger, and more ADV bikes30:T5e8,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 55-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: MX Silver 55L Top Box Capacity: 55 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Silver with Brushed Aluminium Look Locking Mechanism: Heavy-duty dual lock system with keys Waterproof: Yes (with gasket sealing) Mounting: Universal fitment plate included Interior Padding: Yes (to reduce vibration and protect contents) Compatibility: Suitable for adventure bikes, cruisers, touring motorcycles, and superbikes31:T5a6,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 55-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: MX Black Top Box Capacity: 55 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Black Powder-Coated Locking System: Dual-lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (with rubber gasket seal) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Lined with anti-vibration padding Compatibility: Suitable for ADV, Cruiser, Touring & Naked bikes32:T54f,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 5-liter volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Cra