with Saddle Clamp are the ultimate storage companions for serious adventure touring. Made from high-grade aluminium alloy, these panniers feature a tough brushed silver finish and MX styling for a bold, rugged look that complements any adventure or touring motorcycle. With a 36-litre capacity per pannier, these boxes are perfect for storing gear, tools, and travel essentials. The saddle clamp mounting system offers a secure and universal fit for most pannier racks, while the dual locking system and rubber gasket sealing provide security and weatherproof protection. Whether you're navigating rocky trails, highway routes, or weekend rides, the Motocare MX 36L panniers ensure your gear is safe, dry, and ready for the ride. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium MX 36L Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Brushed Silver MX Design Mounting System: Saddle Clamp (compatible with most pannier racks) Locking System: Dual lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (with high-grade rubber gasket) Interior: Foam-padded base for vibration and shock absorption Use Case: Long-distance touring, off-road trails, daily use Bike Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger & more4:T66e,📝 Product Description : Built for the rugged roads and wild trails, the MOTOCARE Aluminium MX 36 Litre Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp offer the perfect combination of toughness, functionality, and aggressive ADV styling. Featuring a sleek matte black powder-coated finish, these panniers are made from high-strength aircraft-grade aluminium, built to endure the demands of off-road adventures and cross-country touring. Each 36-litre pannier box provides ample storage for riding gear, camping tools, or daily essentials. Designed with dual anti-theft locks, weatherproof rubber gasket sealing, and a universal saddle clamp mounting system, these panniers ensure security, durability, and vibration-free performance. The MX edition design adds a bold, aggressive look ideal for Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, and other touring motorcycles. Whether you're heading into the mountains or across state lines, this setup keeps your essentials protected, dry, and ready to roll. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium MX 36L Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Powder-Coated Matte Black (MX Edition) Mounting System: Saddle Clamp (universal fit for most pannier frames) Locking System: Dual anti-theft lock system with keys Waterproof: Yes (with rubber gasket sealing) Interior: Foam base lining to reduce shock and vibration Use Case: Adventure riding, long-distance touring, daily utility Bike Compatibility: KTM Adventure, Royal Enfield Himalayan, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger, and more ADV bikes5:T5e8,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 55-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: MX Silver 55L Top Box Capacity: 55 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Silver with Brushed Aluminium Look Locking Mechanism: Heavy-duty dual lock system with keys Waterproof: Yes (with gasket sealing) Mounting: Universal fitment plate included Interior Padding: Yes (to reduce vibration and protect contents) Compatibility: Suitable for adventure bikes, cruisers, touring motorcycles, and superbikes6:T5a6,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 55-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: MX Black Top Box Capacity: 55 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Black Powder-Coated Locking System: Dual-lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (with rubber gasket seal) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Lined with anti-vibration padding Compatibility: Suitable for ADV, Cruiser, Touring & Naked bikes7:T54f,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 5-liter volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Capacity: 5 Liters Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Silver Waterproof: Yes (rubber gasket sealed) Locking System: Dual-lock anti-theft mechanism Mount Type: Universal (comes with mounting plate) Usage: Ideal for storing rain gear, tools, gloves, gadgets, etc.8:T667,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 45-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic Yellow “GET READY” Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Powder-Coated with Yellow Graphic Print Graphic Design: “GET READY” Adventure Edition Color Theme: Matte Silver Base + Yellow Graphics Locking Mechanism: Dual anti-theft lock with keys Waterproof: Yes, with rubber gasket lining Mounting: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Foam-lined base to protect contents Use Case: Touring, Daily Commute, Weekend Rides Compatibility: Works with most ADV, Cruiser, and Touring motorcycles9:T663,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 45-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic White “GS ADVENTURE” Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Aluminium Base with White GS ADVENTURE Graphics Color Theme: Silver-White Adventure Edition Locking System: Dual locking mechanism with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (sealed with high-grade rubber gasket) Mounting System: Universal fitment plate included Interior: Foam padded base to reduce vibration Use Case: Long-distance touring, weekend rides, daily commute Bike Compatibility: ADV, Touring, Naked, Cruiser motorcyclesa:T659,Introducing the Motocare Aluminum Top Box, the ultimate storage solution designed for motorcycle enthusiasts who demand both rugged durability and ample capacity. With a generous 45-litres volume, this top box provides ample space to stow away all your essentials, whether you're embarking on a cross-country adventure or simply commuting through the city. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, the Motocare Top Box offers unparalleled strength and resilience, ensuring your belongings stay safe and secure, even in the most challenging riding conditions. Its sleek and aerodynamic design not only complements the aesthetics of your bike but also minimizes wind resistance for a smoother ride. Equipped with reliable locking mechanisms, your belongings are kept safe from theft or tampering, giving you peace of mind wherever your journey takes you. The interior of the top box is intelligently designed with organizational features, including partitions and compartments, allowing you to efficiently organize your gear for easy access. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic White-Black “SPEED GS” Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: White-Black Graphic with SPEED GS Design Color Theme: Matte Silver Body + Bold White & Black Print Locking System: Dual lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (weather-resistant rubber gasket) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Shock-absorbing foam base lining Use Case: Ideal for Adventure, Touring, and Daily Commute Compatibility: Suitable for ADV bikes, Cruisers, and Touring Motorcyclesb:T5ad,📝 Product Description: Turn every ride into an adventure with the MOTOCARE Aluminium 45 Litre Graphic KTM ADVENTURE Top Box — the perfect luggage companion for KTM fans and off-road explorers. Built from aerospace-grade aluminium, this top box features a bold KTM-style orange and black adventure graphic, instantly upgrading your bike’s touring character. With a 45-liter capacity, it easily accommodates a full-face helmet, riding gear, tools, and other essentials, making it ideal for long rides, off-road trails, or daily commutes. The box is equipped with a weather-resistant rubber gasket, dual-locking system, and universal mounting plate, offering maximum durability and security across all terrains. Designed to match the ruggedness and style of KTM ADVENTURE series bikes, this top box doesn’t just carry your gear — it carries your identity. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic KTM ADVENTURE Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Silver with KTM Adventure Graphic Graphic Style: Orange/Black KTM ADVENTURE Edition Locking System: Dual-lock with anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (rubber-sealed for weather protection) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Foam-lined base to reduce vibration Use Case: Ideal for Touring, Adventure Rides, Daily Commute Compatibility: Best suited for KTM Adventure Series, ADV bikes, Touring motorcyclesc:T5be,Rule the roads in style with the MOTOCARE Aluminium 45 Litre Graphic BMW GS White Top Box — a perfect blend of rugged performance and BMW GS-inspired aesthetics. Tailored for adventure touring, this top box is made from aircraft-grade aluminium and features an iconic white BMW GS-style graphic that resonates with the spirit of global riders and off-road explorers. With a 45-liter storage capacity, it easily holds a full-face helmet, riding gloves, toolkits, and essentials for your long-haul trips or daily commutes. Its durable weatherproof design, secure dual-locking system, and universal mounting kit ensure reliability and compatibility with most ADV and touring motorcycles. Whether you're riding a BMW GS or just love the adventure lifestyle, this top box brings the premium look, security, and storage you need for every ride. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L BMW GS Graphic (White Edition) Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aerospace-grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Silver with White BMW GS Graphics Design Theme: BMW GS Adventure Styling Color Scheme: Silver base + White/Black GS Logo Graphics Locking System: Dual anti-theft locks with keys Waterproof: Yes (weatherproof rubber gasket seal) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Foam base padding to absorb vibration Use Case: Long-distance touring, adventure rides, city commute Bike Compatibility: BMW GS Series, ADV, Touring, and Cruiser Bikesd:T599,📝 Product Description : Unleash your racing spirit on the road with the MOTOCARE Aluminium 45 Litre Graphic Black MOTO GP Top Box. This premium luggage solution is inspired by the thrill of MotoGP racing, featuring a sleek matte black finish with bold MOTO GP graphics — perfect for riders who live for speed, precision, and style. Crafted from aerospace-grade aluminium, this 45-litre motorcycle top box offers exceptional durability, weatherproof protection, and spacious storage for your helmet, gloves, jackets, and road essentials. Whether you're touring, commuting, or hitting the twisties, the dual locking system and universal mounting plate keep your gear safe and secure. Designed to match high-performance motorcycles, especially naked and sport-tourers, this box turns your machine into a MotoGP-inspired touring beast. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic Black MOTO GP Edition Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Black with MotoGP Graphics Color Theme: Black with Red/White MotoGP Racing Design Locking System: Dual key-operated anti-theft locks Weather Protection: Yes (sealed with rubber gasket) Mounting System: Universal mounting plate included Interior: Anti-vibration foam-padded bottom Use Case: Racing-style touring, weekend rides, sport bike luggage Bike Compatibility: Sport bikes, naked bikes, touring motorcycles, street bikese:T58b,📝 Product Description : Conquer every mile in true ADV style with the MOTOCARE Aluminium 45 Litre Graphic Black GS ADVENTURE Top Box. Built tough for rugged terrain and endless journeys, this top box is crafted from aerospace-grade aluminium and finished in stealthy matte black with premium GS ADVENTURE graphics — made for the modern-day explorer. With a 45L storage capacity, it comfortably holds a full-face helmet, gloves, rain gear, and trail essentials. It features a dual locking mechanism, weather-sealed gasket, and universal mounting plate for maximum security and convenience. Whether you ride a BMW GS, Himalayan, KTM ADV, or any touring machine, this top box is your ultimate luggage solution for adventure and style. Ride hard, pack smart — the GS ADVENTURE edition is engineered for riders who live to explore. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 45L Graphic Black “GS ADVENTURE” Capacity: 45 Litres Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Matte Black with GS ADVENTURE Graphics Design Theme: Adventure Touring / GS Style Locking System: Dual lock system with 2 anti-theft keys Waterproof: Yes (Rubber gasket-sealed lid) Mounting Plate: Universal mounting kit included Interior: Padded base for vibration damping Use Case: Long rides, off-road touring, city commuting Bike Compatibility: BMW GS, KTM Adventure, Himalayan, ADV, Cruiser, Naked & Touring Bikesf:T5ba,📝 Product Description : Take your motorcycle touring setup to the next level with MOTOCARE Aluminium 36 Litre Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp — the ultimate side luggage solution for long-distance rides, off-road adventures, and overlanding. Built from aircraft-grade aluminium alloy, these 36-litre panniers are both lightweight and extremely durable. The brushed silver finish adds a rugged yet premium look to your bike, while the saddle clamp mounting system ensures a strong, rattle-free fit on compatible pannier frames. Ideal for carrying camping gear, riding essentials, or tools, these panniers are fully weatherproof, lockable, and designed to endure harsh terrain and changing weather conditions. Whether you ride a Himalayan, BMW GS, KTM Adventure, or any ADV bike, these Motocare pannier boxes are built to go the distance with you. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Product Name: Aluminium 36L Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Brushed Matte Silver Locking System: Dual key locks (each box) Mounting: Saddle clamp system (compatible with most pannier racks) Waterproof: Yes, with rubber gasket seal Interior: Foam base lining to reduce vibration Use Case: Touring, Adventure Rides, Long-Distance Travel, Utility Storage Bike Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Triumph Tiger, and other ADV/Touring bikes with pannier mounts10:T5f9,📝 Product Description : Designed for adventure without limits, the MOTOCARE Aluminium 36 Litre BMW GS Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp are the ultimate touring solution for riders who live to explore. Precision-crafted from aerospace-grade aluminium, these panniers feature a brushed silver finish and bold BMW GS-inspired graphics, giving your motorcycle a powerful touring presence. Each pannier offers a 36-litre capacity, ideal for storing riding gear, travel essentials, camping tools, or even groceries for daily commutes. Built tough and weatherproof, these side boxes come with dual locking mechanisms, vibration-damping foam interiors, and a secure saddle clamp mounting system that fits most ADV pannier racks. Whether you're riding a BMW GS, Himalayan, KTM Adventure, or Triumph Tiger, these panniers provide rugged performance, reliable protection, and an authentic adventure aesthetic. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Model: Aluminium 36L BMW GS Silver Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres per pannier (total 72L with pair) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Brushed Silver with BMW GS Graphic Locking System: Dual lock system with anti-theft keys Mounting System: Saddle clamp (fits most pannier rack systems) Waterproof: Yes, with rubber gasket sealing Interior: Foam base lining for shock and vibration protection Use Case: Touring, Adventure, Off-road, Daily Commute Compatibility: BMW GS Series, Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM ADV, Triumph Tiger, Yezdi Adventure, and more11:T688,📝 Product Description : Elevate your motorcycle touring experience with the MOTOCARE Aluminium 36 Litre BMW GS Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp – the perfect combination of rugged performance and premium ADV styling. Designed for adventure seekers and long-distance riders, these black aluminium pannier boxes feature a bold BMW GS-inspired design that adds unmatched style and utility to your ride. Built from aerospace-grade aluminium alloy, each 36-litre pannier is engineered to withstand harsh terrain, heavy weather, and extended touring. The powder-coated matte black finish resists scratches and blends seamlessly with modern adventure bikes. Equipped with a secure saddle clamp mounting system, dual anti-theft locks, and weather-sealed gaskets, these panniers ensure your gear stays safe, dry, and vibration-free. Whether you're riding a BMW GS, KTM Adventure, Royal Enfield Himalayan, Yezdi Adventure, or Triumph Tiger, these panniers deliver the durability and style needed for true overlanding. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Product Name: Aluminium 36L BMW GS Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres per pannier (Total: 72L for a pair) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Powder-Coated Matte Black with BMW GS Graphics Mounting System: Saddle Clamp (universal pannier rack fitment) Locking System: Dual key lock per pannier (anti-theft) Waterproof: Yes (rubber gasket sealed) Interior: Foam-lined base to absorb shocks and vibrations Use Case: Adventure touring, off-road expeditions, highway rides, city commutes Bike Compatibility: BMW GS, KTM ADV, RE Himalayan, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger & other ADV bikes12:T5f0,📝 Product Description : Conquer every trail and highway with confidence using the MOTOCARE Aluminium 36 Litre Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp — the perfect blend of rugged utility, sleek design, and ADV functionality. Crafted from aircraft-grade aluminium, these 36-litre side pannier boxes are finished in stealthy matte black to perfectly match modern adventure motorcycles. Equipped with a secure saddle clamp system, they offer a strong and stable fit on most touring and ADV pannier frames. These black aluminium panniers are built to withstand all terrains and weather conditions. With their dual-lock system, weatherproof sealing, and foam-lined interiors, they protect your gear — whether you're packing tools, camping gear, or touring essentials. Whether you're exploring Himalayan backroads or weekend-tripping on your KTM, Motocare's 36L black panniers are designed for riders who go the distance in style. 📦 Product Specifications: Brand: Motocare Product Name: Aluminium 36L Black Panniers with Saddle Clamp Capacity: 36 Litres (each pannier) Material: Aircraft-Grade Aluminium Alloy Finish: Powder-Coated Matte Black Locking System: Dual anti-theft key locks (each box) Mounting System: Saddle Clamp Mount (universal fit with pannier frames) Waterproof: Yes (rubber gasket sealed) Interior: Foam base padding for shock absorption Use Case: Long-distance touring, adventure rides, commuting Bike Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan, KTM Adventure, BMW GS, Yezdi Adventure, Triumph Tiger & more13:T5d3,Built for riders who refuse to let weather or terrain dictate the journey, the 66BHP x Vantora Sealpac is a rugged, fully waterproof luggage solution designed for everything from daily commuting to long-distance adventure touring. Featuring a durable waterproof construction and a universal mounting system, Sealpac can be configured as a tail bag, saddle bag, crash guard bag, or backpack, giving you unmatched flexibility for every ride. Whether you're carrying tools, riding gear, electronics, clothing, or camping essentials, Sealpac keeps your belongings protected from rain, dust, and road grime. Each bag comes complete with heavy-duty mounting straps and a backpack conversion kit, allowing seamless transitions between motorcycle and off-bike use. Key Features 100% Waterproof Construction Multipurpose Mounting Design Can Be Used as Tail Bag, Saddle Bag or Crash Guard Bag Backpack Conversion Included Universal Fitment for Most Motorcycles Heavy-Duty Quick-Mount Strap System Reinforced Outer Shell for Added Protection Reflective Elements for Improved Visibility Ideal for Touring, Adventure Riding & Daily Commutes Available Sizes 5 Litres 10 Litres 20 Litres 30 Litres Perfect For Adventure Touring Weekend Rides Daily Commuting Off-Road Expeditions Motorcycle Camping Long-Distance Travel One luggage system. Multiple mounting options. Unlimited adventures. The Sealpac is engineered to adapt to your motorcycle, your gear, and your riding style—wherever the road takes you.14:T1172,@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap'); .stormx-wrapper{ font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background:#050505; color:#ffffff; padding:40px 20px; border-radius:28px; overflow:hidden; position:relative; } .stormx-wrapper *{ box-sizing:border-box; } .stormx-wrapper:before{ content:''; position:absolute; top:-120px; right:-80px; width:300px; height:300px; background:rgba(180,255,0,0.18); filter:blur(80px); border-radius:50%; } .stormx-wrapper:after{ content:''; position:absolute; bottom:-100px; left:-80px; width:260px; height:260px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); filter:blur(90px); border-radius:50%; } .stormx-container{ position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:1200px; margin:auto; } .stormx-badge{ display:inline-block; background:rgba(180,255,0,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(180,255,0,0.25); color:#d8ff59; padding:10px 18px; border-radius:50px; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; margin-bottom:22px; backdrop-filter:blur(12px); } .stormx-title{ font-size:48px; line-height:1.1; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:20px; } .stormx-title span{ color:#d8ff59; } .stormx-subtitle{ color:#cfcfcf; font-size:17px; line-height:1.8; max-width:900px; margin-bottom:40px; } .stormx-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap:20px; margin-bottom:45px; } .stormx-card{ background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding:24px; border-radius:24px; backdrop-filter:blur(18px); transition:0.3s ease; } .stormx-card:hover{ transform:translateY(-6px); border-color:rgba(180,255,0,0.35); } .stormx-card h3{ font-size:18px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#d8ff59; font-weight:700; } .stormx-card p{ font-size:14px; color:#d6d6d6; line-height:1.7; } .stormx-section-title{ font-size:30px; margin-bottom:24px; font-weight:800; } .stormx-list{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap:18px; margin-bottom:45px; } .stormx-list-item{ background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding:18px 20px; border-radius:18px; font-size:15px; color:#efefef; backdrop-filter:blur(10px); } .stormx-package{ background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(180,255,0,0.14), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)); border:1px solid rgba(180,255,0,0.18); border-radius:28px; padding:32px; margin-bottom:40px; backdrop-filter:blur(16px); } .stormx-package ul{ padding-left:18px; margin-top:15px; } .stormx-package li{ margin-bottom:10px; color:#e8e8e8; } .stormx-why{ background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius:28px; padding:35px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); backdrop-filter:blur(15px); } .stormx-why p{ color:#d6d6d6; line-height:1.9; font-size:16px; } .stormx-highlight{ color:#d8ff59; font-weight:700; } @media(max-width:768px){ .stormx-title{ font-size:34px; } .stormx-section-title{ font-size:24px; } .stormx-wrapper{ padding:30px 15px; } } ALL-WEATHER RIDING GEAR 66BHP Storm X Raincoat The all-new 66BHP Storm X Raincoat is engineered specifically for motorcycle riders who demand reliable protection during extreme weather conditions. Whether you're navigating city traffic or touring through heavy monsoon rain, Storm X delivers dependable waterproof performance without compromising comfort, flexibility, or rider mobility. 100% Waterproof Premium waterproof construction keeps you dry and protected even during intense rain conditions. Reflective Safety Reflective detailing and high-visibility neon finish improve visibility during night rides and low-light weather. Lightweight Comfort Designed for long rides with a lightweight build that offers comfort without unnecessary bulk. Windproof Protection Helps block strong winds and improves rider comfort during highway and touring rides. Rider-Friendly Fit Ergonomic fit tailored for motorcycle riding posture and unrestricted movement. Free Riding Pant Complete rain protection setup included with every Storm X Raincoat purchase. Ideal For ✔ Daily Commuting ✔ Touring & Long Rides ✔ Monsoon Riding ✔ Highway Travel ✔ Adventure Riders Package Includes 1 x 66BHP Storm X Raincoat Jacket 1 x Free Riding Pant Why Choose 66BHP Storm X? The 66BHP Storm X Raincoat combines waterproof performance, rider comfort, and enhanced visibility into one premium riding solution. Designed specifically for motorcyclists, it delivers dependable protection for everyday commuting as well as long touring rides during the monsoon season.15:T400,The Aluminum Top Box is an engineered storage solution designed for serious riders who demand reliability and functionality. Constructed from lightweight yet rigid aluminum, this 65-liter capacity box delivers exceptional durability without compromising your motorcycle's handling characteristics. The expansive interior accommodates helmets, jackets, tools, and touring essentials with room to spare, while the secure locking mechanism ensures your valuables remain protected during transit. Weather-resistant construction shields contents from rain and road debris, making it ideal for extended journeys and daily commuting alike. The sleek black finish complements most motorcycle aesthetics while maintaining a professional appearance. Quick-release mounting hardware enables hassle-free installation and removal, giving you flexibility between touring and sport riding modes. Whether navigating city streets or conquering highway miles, this top box combines practical storage with the durability serious riders expect.19:X\n1e:X\n1e:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"6H4oyVnlEj54daI7c5-Yk\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Touring Accessories\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/touring-accessories\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"handle\":\"touring-accessories\",\"initialCollection\":{\"id\":\"gid://shopify/Collection/555261854013\",\"handle\":\"touring-accessories\",\"title\":\"Touring Accessories\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"